          "id": "p7-disguise-01",
          "title": "Why disguise",
          "body": "A quarterback reads the safeties before the snap. Two deep safeties look like Cover 2 or Cover 4. Defenses show that picture, then rotate after the snap so the QB's pre-snap read is wrong.",
          "concept": "disguise"
        },
